{"seq":3,"slug":"category-sellthrough-profit-kpi","title":"动销率/贡献毛利/品类健康 KPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/assortment-lifecycle-kpi/category-sellthrough-profit-kpi","wordCount":1951,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"动销率-贡献毛利-品类健康-kpi\">动销率/贡献毛利/品类健康 KPI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>品类规划做完之后必须能被度量。选取度量时要警惕一件事：<strong>只要一个指标能被考核，它就会被优化，而单指标优化几乎总会牺牲别的维度</strong>。品类健康度量因此不是选一个&quot;最好的指标&quot;，而是选一小组互相制衡的指标，并明确它们联合起来如何判读。</p>\n<p>三个核心指标构成这个小组：<strong>动销率</strong>（结构中有多少商品在动）、<strong>贡献毛利</strong>（动的东西赚不赚钱）、以及<strong>周转效率</strong>（赚的钱占用多少库存才拿到）。三者合起来才能回答&quot;这个品类是不是健康的&quot;。</p>\n<p>跨境的度量还需要处理退货这一层。国内外零售都可讨论销量与毛利，但跨境的退货同时消耗正向履约、逆向物流与商品贬值三笔成本，忽略它会让毛利看起来健康而实际失血。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动销率的口径与陷阱\">动销率的口径与陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"定义与分母选择\">定义与分母选择</h3><p>动销率的定义是期间内有销量的 SKU 数占在架 SKU 数的比例。分子分母的口径都必须显式声明，因为它们决定了这个指标能否跨期比较：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径项</th>\n<th>可选定义</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动销分母</td>\n<td>期末在架 SKU / 期间曾上架 SKU（平均在架）</td>\n<td>期末口径会低估动销率（当期新上架的算入分母但尚未卖出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动销分子</td>\n<td>有正销量 / 销量超过最小有效量</td>\n<td>最小有效量口径可剔除单件偶发销量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期间长度</td>\n<td>30 天 / 90 天</td>\n<td>短窗口对慢销品类系统性偏低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级</td>\n<td>SKU / 款式（spu）</td>\n<td>款式口径下同款多色会合并，通常高于 SKU 口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中应同时保留 SKU 口径与款式口径，前者用于淘汰决策，后者用于对外的结构沟通——因为用户感知的&quot;这款有没有货&quot;是按款式而非按变体。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可操纵性\">可操纵性</h3><p>动销率最危险的特性是它极易被操纵：<strong>下架零动销 SKU 会让动销率上升，而经营质量没有任何变化</strong>。同理，一次性大量上新如果新品的首月动销率高，会短暂拉高整体动销率。</p>\n<p>因此动销率单独使用是无意义的。它必须与贡献毛利额联合判读，二者的四种组合各有明确的诊断含义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动销率</th>\n<th>贡献毛利额</th>\n<th>判读</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>结构改善真实发生</td>\n<td>维持当前汰换节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>下架砍掉了有贡献的长尾</td>\n<td>复核淘汰名单的结构豁免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>新增 SKU 尚未起量</td>\n<td>扩张期的正常状态，观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>结构在腐烂</td>\n<td>启动紧急汰换与结构重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行是最容易犯的错误：为了漂亮的动销率而砍掉一批低贡献但在矩阵上填补缺口的 SKU。这正是 <a href=\"shelf-delist-lastplace-rule\">末位淘汰与退市</a> 中&quot;结构豁免&quot;存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贡献毛利的口径统一\">贡献毛利的口径统一</h2><h3 id=\"分母与扣项\">分母与扣项</h3><p>贡献毛利的定义是单位售价减单位变动成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = P - V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，衡量单笔销售在覆盖固定成本前的贡献（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contribution_margin\">Contribution margin，Wikipedia</a>）。它在品类度量里最容易出错的地方是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 的边界。跨境的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 至少要含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 品类贡献毛利月度汇总（变动成本口径）&#10;SELECT f.category_id,&#10;       f.market_code,&#10;       date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, f.order_date)                     AS period,&#10;       SUM(f.units)                                          AS units,&#10;       SUM(f.units * f.unit_price)                            AS revenue,&#10;       SUM(f.units * (&#10;             f.unit_landed_cost        -- 出厂 + 头程 + 关税&#10;           + f.unit_fulfill_cost       -- 仓内 + 尾程派送&#10;           + f.unit_payment_fee        -- 支付通道费&#10;           + f.unit_platform_fee       -- 平台佣金&#10;       ))                                                     AS var_cost,&#10;       SUM(f.units * f.unit_price)&#10;         - SUM(f.units * (&#10;             f.unit_landed_cost + f.unit_fulfill_cost&#10;             + f.unit_payment_fee + f.unit_platform_fee))     AS contribution_margin,&#10;       -- 退货的净影响：逆向物流 + 退回商品贬值&#10;       SUM(f.returned_units * f.unit_reverse_cost)            AS return_cost,&#10;       SUM(f.units * f.unit_price)&#10;         - SUM(f.units * (&#10;             f.unit_landed_cost + f.unit_fulfill_cost&#10;             + f.unit_payment_fee + f.unit_platform_fee))&#10;         - SUM(f.returned_units * f.unit_reverse_cost)        AS contribution_after_returns&#10;FROM sales_fact f&#10;WHERE f.order_date &gt;= $1 AND f.order_date &lt; $2&#10;  AND f.market_code = $3&#10;GROUP BY f.category_id, f.market_code, period&#10;ORDER BY f.category_id, period;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 品类贡献毛利月度汇总（变动成本口径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">             f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_landed_cost</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        -- 出厂 + 头程 + 关税</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_fulfill_cost</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 仓内 + 尾程派送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_payment_fee</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        -- 支付通道费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_platform_fee</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 平台佣金</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ))                                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> var_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">             f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_landed_cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_fulfill_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_payment_fee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_platform_fee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contribution_margin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 退货的净影响：逆向物流 + 退回商品贬值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">returned_units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_reverse_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">             f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_landed_cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_fulfill_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_payment_fee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_platform_fee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">returned_units</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_reverse_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contribution_after_returns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales_fact f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个输出列 <code>contribution_margin</code> 与 <code>contribution_after_returns</code> 的差异就是退货的影响。品类复盘必须用后者，选品与定价用前者——因为定价决策发生在不知道具体退货率的时点，而复盘发生在退货已经发生之后。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退货率的杠杆\">退货率的杠杆</h3><p>用有效贡献的形式可以直观看到退货的作用：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = (1-r)(P-V) - rL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是退货率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是单件退货净损失。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P-V=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0 升到 0.25 时有效贡献从 12 降到 6.75。这意味着<strong>退货率的敏感度可能高于采购成本的敏感度</strong>——把退货率从 25% 降到 15% 的收益，可能超过把采购价压低 8%。这是跨境品类度量必须单列退货率的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品类健康评分卡\">品类健康评分卡</h2><h3 id=\"六维评分卡\">六维评分卡</h3><p>把三个核心指标拆成六个可观测的维度，每个维度给出阈值判读，组合成一个品类健康评分卡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>健康线</th>\n<th>警戒线</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动销率</td>\n<td>90 天 SKU 口径</td>\n<td>≥ 品类基线</td>\n<td>&lt; 基线 80%</td>\n<td>销量事实表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贡献毛利率</td>\n<td>含退货后 / 收入</td>\n<td>≥ 目标档位</td>\n<td>&lt; 目标档位 70%</td>\n<td>贡献毛利汇总</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存周转</td>\n<td>销货成本 / 平均库存成本</td>\n<td>≥ 目标档位</td>\n<td>&lt; 目标档位 70%</td>\n<td>库存与成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售罄率</td>\n<td>期间销量 / 期间可供量</td>\n<td>落在目标区间</td>\n<td>偏离区间 ±30%</td>\n<td>库存流水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货率</td>\n<td>退货件数 / 发货件数</td>\n<td>≤ 类目均值</td>\n<td>&gt; 均值 1.5 倍</td>\n<td>售后事实表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构健康度</td>\n<td>衰退期 SKU 占比</td>\n<td>≤ 30%</td>\n<td>&gt; 40%</td>\n<td>生命周期推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>库存周转的口径遵循标准关系：周转率 = 销货成本 / 平均库存（成本口径），平均库存取期初期末均值，平均售出天数 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>365</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>周转率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">365 / \\text{周转率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周转率</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inventory_turnover\">Inventory turnover，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>售罄率的定义是&quot;期间卖出的比例&quot;，其口径依赖期间与可供量的定义，因此<strong>售罄率的价值在于趋势而非绝对值</strong>——它既可以因为定价太低而偏高，也可以因为备货过多而偏低，单看它会得出反向结论（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sell-through\">Sell-through，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定与动作\">判定与动作</h3><p>评分卡不是打分排名，而是<strong>分诊</strong>。每个维度超标触发对应的动作分支：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[六维评分卡] --&gt; B{动销率或结构健康度告警}&#10;  A --&gt; C{贡献毛利率告警}&#10;  A --&gt; D{周转或售罄率告警}&#10;  A --&gt; E{退货率告警}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| F[启动汰换&lt;br/&gt;复核豁免名单]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| G[拆解价格/成本/退货&lt;br/&gt;价差量差分解]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| H[复核 OTB 分配&lt;br/&gt;与深度决策]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| I[归因质量/尺码/描述&lt;br/&gt;非选品问题]&#10;  F --&gt; J[品类复盘结论]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[六维评分卡] --&gt; B{动销率或结构健康度告警}\n  A --&gt; C{贡献毛利率告警}\n  A --&gt; D{周转或售罄率告警}\n  A --&gt; E{退货率告警}\n  B --&gt;|是| F[启动汰换&lt;br/&gt;复核豁免名单]\n  C --&gt;|是| G[拆解价格/成本/退货&lt;br/&gt;价差量差分解]\n  D --&gt;|是| H[复核 OTB 分配&lt;br/&gt;与深度决策]\n  E --&gt;|是| I[归因质量/尺码/描述&lt;br/&gt;非选品问题]\n  F --&gt; J[品类复盘结论]\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p><code>I</code> 分支很重要：退货率告警<strong>不能</strong>直接导向选品调整，因为高退货率的常见根因是尺码表不准、商品描述与实际不符、或图片与实物差异——这些都是商品信息与运营问题。把它们归成选品问题会导致错误地下架一款本可救回的商品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻主题的接口\">与相邻主题的接口</h2><p>品类健康度量输出的结论会流回本 hub 的多个环节，也会越界到相邻 hub 的职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>回流的内部接口</strong>：动销率与结构健康度 → <a href=\"category-lifecycle-rationalization\">品类/单品生命周期与汰换</a>；贡献毛利率 → <a href=\"../open-to-buy-budget/category-margin-turnover-target\">品类毛利/周转目标与预算约束</a> 的目标校准；周转与 OTB 使用率 → <a href=\"../open-to-buy-budget/open-to-buy-category-budget\">Open-to-Buy 预算与品类分配</a> 的权重校正。</li>\n<li><strong>越界的相邻职责</strong>：单品的生命周期阶段与库龄结构、清仓降价的执行与残值处理，属于库存生命周期与清仓定价主题的职责；需求侧预测的准确度评价属于需求预测与补货主题的职责；招商侧引入的品牌结构变化属于平台招商主题的职责。本 hub 只产出品类层面的结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>品类健康度量必须是互相制衡的一小组指标；单指标被考核就会被优化，并牺牲其它维度。</li>\n<li>动销率极易被操纵（下架零动销 SKU 即可拉高），必须与贡献毛利额联合判读；四象限组合各有明确诊断。</li>\n<li>贡献毛利的口径差异集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 的边界；跨境必须含出厂、头程、关税、履约、支付费、平台佣金，并单列退货的净影响。</li>\n<li>退货是杠杆效应，其敏感度可能高于采购成本；退货率告警应导向商品信息与质量归因，而非直接调整选品。</li>\n<li>库存周转、售罄率遵循标准口径；售罄率的价值在趋势而非绝对值，因为定价与备货都会扭曲它。</li>\n<li>评分卡是分诊工具而非排名工具，四个告警分支对应四类完全不同的动作。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动销率/贡献毛利/品类健康 KPI","id":"动销率-贡献毛利-品类健康-kpi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动销率的口径与陷阱","id":"动销率的口径与陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"定义与分母选择","id":"定义与分母选择"},{"level":3,"text":"可操纵性","id":"可操纵性"},{"level":2,"text":"贡献毛利的口径统一","id":"贡献毛利的口径统一"},{"level":3,"text":"分母与扣项","id":"分母与扣项"},{"level":3,"text":"退货率的杠杆","id":"退货率的杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"品类健康评分卡","id":"品类健康评分卡"},{"level":3,"text":"六维评分卡","id":"六维评分卡"},{"level":3,"text":"判定与动作","id":"判定与动作"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻主题的接口","id":"与相邻主题的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"末位淘汰与退市","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/assortment-lifecycle-kpi/shelf-delist-lastplace-rule"},"next":null}